    "Defense Attributes": "Fire 20, Water 20, Wind 53, Earth 20, Holy 20, Unholy 20",
    "Skills": "Raid Boss Lv. 1 Raid Boss reward chance is reduced based on the level difference. Boss is higher: +5 - 85%, +6 - 70%, +7 - 50%, +8 - 35%. Player is higher: +6 - 85%, +7 - 70%, +8 - 50%. If player is 9 or more levels higher, Raid Curse is applied. Raid Boss Lv. 1 Gracia's Great Noble who was not able to return to his country after losing in the Aden-Gracia War. During the war, he became lost inside of Cruma Tower with his troops. While inside the tower he had the opportunity to recruit a few Lesser Giants to his cause. When he finally escaped from the tower, the war was already over. The only thing he was left with was a few loyal servants and an enormous bounty on his head. Presently, he is desperately trying to flee to Elmore Kingdom to preserve his life. Humanoids Lv. 6 Takes 15% increased damage from attacks that are effective against Humanoids. Atk. Spd. +2.5% Accuracy +3 Evasion +2 P. Def. -5% Received Critical Damage +5% Resistance to Bleed -10% Light Armor Type Lv. 3 Weak P. Def. and strong Evasion. Resist Full Magic Attack Lv. 1",
